    88	  - For an event, one more key, `outcome_on_due_day`: "Yes", "Ruled out", "Still open" or "cannot tell", meaning which of the question's own
    89	    rungs the material supports on the due day, with items. It must agree with `yes_no` ("Yes" exactly when yes_no is true). Source: D409, the event
    90	    in three outcomes, and council round 2 ("a yes/no reference cannot decide which one holds").
    91	- **Validity schema** (code, fixed now):
    92	  - the brief's keys, with the types the brief gives;
    93	  - `question_id` is c01 to c15, each exactly once;
    94	  - when `no_view` is true, every other field may be null;
    95	  - otherwise:
