   203	- **An unexercised result** may come from no_view, invalid or unresolved references, missing judgements, unresolved shown checks, "cannot tell"
   204	  events, or delivery. The report names which.
   205	- **A missed result** is specific to this reference, these questions and these stored judgements.
   206	- **Most A–B disagreements will reach Alex split by family.** On 9 of Stage B's 12 splits, each third reader sided with its own family's first
   207	  reader. That was on judgement verdicts, not reference answers.
