   234	| Reader B as the proposed reference, A as noise | D262 |
   235	| Third readers see both answers | Stage A third readers (`collect_readings.py disputes`) |
   236	| Shown-check third readers without the answers | `control-reader-brief.md` |
   237	| All disputes to Alex; signing his alone | D658; AGENTS §7.1; D592 |
